sequenceDiagram
  participant Phone
  participant Verifier
  participant Store as Private file store

  Phone->>Verifier: POST /v1/nonce
  Verifier-->>Phone: one-time nonce
  Note over Phone: Camera only. h = SHA-256 of the photo.<br/>m = canonical metadata. Sign h || SHA-256(m).
  Phone->>Verifier: POST /v1/projects/{id}/evidence
  Verifier->>Verifier: Check signature, nonce, and parcel radius
  Verifier->>Store: Save the original bytes
  Verifier->>Verifier: leaf = SHA-256 of 0x00, h, hash of m, signature
  Verifier-->>Phone: accepted, or the rejection reason
  Note over Verifier: Seal later builds the Merkle root from the leaves.<br/>Only that root goes on the chain.
